  <bib:Article rdf:about="#c3po">
    <z:itemType>conferencePaper</z:itemType>
    <dc:title>C-3PO: Compact Plug-and-Play Proxy Optimization to Achieve Human-like Retrieval-Augmented Generation</dc:title>
    <dc:date>2025</dc:date>
    <z:url>https://proceedings.mlr.press/v267/chen25an.html</z:url>
    <dc:identifier>arXiv: 2502.06205; PMLR: v267/chen25an</dc:identifier>
    <z:extra>发表状态：ICML 2025 正式同行评审论文。阅读优先级：P0。它做了什么：在冻结 retriever 与 LLM 之间加入轻量多 Agent proxy，由三个角色决定是否检索、生成查询和筛选文档，并用树状 rollout 与强化学习训练。它没做什么：没有跨问题的 query-repair episode、经验晋升、历史可靠性与当前适用性分离，也没有把 BASE 正确而干预后错误作为核心风险。GrowRAG 必学：plug-and-play、frozen base、agentic controller 不能作为创新；我们的增量必须来自可追溯且受伤害约束的历史修复迁移。</z:extra>
    <bib:authors><rdf:Seq>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Guoxin</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Chen</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Minpeng</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Liao</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Peiying</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Yu</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Dingmin</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Wang</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Zile</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Qiao</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Chao</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Yang</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Xin</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Zhao</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Kai</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Fan</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
    </rdf:Seq></bib:authors>
    <dcterms:isPartOf><bib:Proceedings><dc:title>Proceedings of the 42nd International Conference on Machine Learning</dc:title></bib:Proceedings></dcterms:isPartOf>
    <bib:pages>8530–8551</bib:pages>
    <z:tags><rdf:Bag><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>P0-创新边界</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>同行评审-ICML</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>Agentic-RAG</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li></rdf:Bag></z:tags>
  </bib:Article>

  <bib:Article rdf:about="#sparkle">
    <z:itemType>conferencePaper</z:itemType>
    <dc:title>SPARKLE: A Structured and Plug-and-play Agentic Retrieval Policy for Adaptive RAG Models</dc:title>
    <dc:date>2026</dc:date>
    <z:url>https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1793/</z:url>
    <dc:identifier>DOI: 10.18653/v1/2026.acl-long.1793</dc:identifier>
    <z:extra>发表状态：ACL 2026 Long，正式同行评审论文。阅读优先级：P0，第 1 篇。它做了什么：增加独立 proxy，以结构化 KG reasoning chain 表达知识缺口，据此决定是否检索、生成目标查询并选择能补缺口的证据；用 PPO 和二叉树 rollout 训练。它没做什么：没有跨问题历史修复经验、episode 到长期卡片的晋升，也没有 reliability/applicability/conditional-harm 的安全复用协议。GrowRAG 必学：先显式表达失败原因再改写已经被覆盖；我们应把结构化 gap 当作历史经验匹配和事后验证接口，而不是创新本身。</z:extra>
    <bib:authors><rdf:Seq>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Jinyuan</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Fang</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Zaiqiao</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Meng</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Craig</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Macdonald</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
    </rdf:Seq></bib:authors>
    <dcterms:isPartOf><bib:Proceedings><dc:title>Proceedings of the 64th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (Volume 1: Long Papers)</dc:title></bib:Proceedings></dcterms:isPartOf>
    <bib:pages>38699–38719</bib:pages>
    <z:tags><rdf:Bag><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>P0-必须精读</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>同行评审-ACL</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li><rdf:li><z:AutomaticTag><rdf:value>结构化缺口</rdf:value></z:AutomaticTag></rdf:li></rdf:Bag></z:tags>
  </bib:Article>

  <bib:Article rdf:about="#segmem">
    <z:itemType>conferencePaper</z:itemType>
    <dc:title>SegMem-RAG: Adaptive Memory for Retrieval-Augmented Generation in Open-Ended Knowledge Environments</dc:title>
    <dc:date>2026</dc:date>
    <z:url>https://ojs.aaai.org/index.php/AAAI/article/view/40320</z:url>
    <dc:identifier>DOI: 10.1609/aaai.v40i36.40320</dc:identifier>
    <z:extra>发表状态：AAAI 2026 Technical Track，正式同行评审论文。阅读优先级：P0。它做了什么：在开放、多语料环境中维护结构化记忆，通过经验与自反思学习跨语料路由；论文涉及 episodic、procedural、semantic memory。它没做什么：研究重点是语料源与检索路径选择，不是具体 q→q′ 修复的配对收益、来源版本和正确到错误风险。GrowRAG 必学：双层/多层记忆和经验路由都不是创新；我们必须把记忆单位和风险目标限定到单 query repair transfer。</z:extra>
    <bib:authors><rdf:Seq>
      <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:givenName>Xuanbo</foaf:givenName><foaf:surname>Fan</foaf:surname></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
